<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 49.9 percent in the week ended December 27, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 54.6 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages fell 47.6 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index dipped 24.3 percent to 272.8 from 360.4 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 12.9 percent to 156.8 in the latest survey from a revised 180.0 in the previous week.  </p>
